  Context deletion plan

    Name             retired
    Input revisions  selected rev-3b8d0f5a9c1e4d7b2a6f8c0e1d3b5a7f
    Keyring          removed with every secret version it holds
    Reservations     libvirt-domain:bootwright-lab-rhel-01, media:rhel-9.iso,
                     socket:192.0.2.1:8000
    Owned objects    abandoned unmanaged; bootwright status --context retired and bootwright
                     diff --context retired list them, diff also what the selected input no
                     longer declares
    Work areas       left in place with the material their installations were given: cluster
                     sno on Machine controller; machine rhel-01 on Machine controller
    Freed keys       libvirt-domain:bootwright-lab-rhel-01, socket:192.0.2.1:8000; another
                     context may then claim a resource an abandoned object still uses, such as
                     the management controller of a powered-off Machine
    Same name        remove the abandoned objects by hand before bootwright context init --name
                     retired again, because that name reads them as its own, and never reuse
                     retired on another controller that shares a provider host
